+// ButterEye: mpv rebuilds the VapourSynth core on every seek and loads this
+// module again with it. Upstream destroyed the ncnn GPU instance when its last
+// filter was freed, so each seek paid about 1 s to create the instance and load
+// the model again. Now the instance lives as long as the process (ncnn's own
